{
 "_note": "动态提醒 · 边沿(doc/ccusage-live-timeline.md §6.1)。有一路 Claude Code 弹了授权、等你超过设定分钟还没人点 → 提醒,点名项目与等了多久。同一次等待只响一次;多路同时在等时点名等得最久的那路,它被处理后下一路照样会响。\n⚠️ 这是手机端检查:免费档 30 分钟一次、Pro 按 5 分钟申请但仍受系统调度(Android 约 15 分钟,iOS / 鸿蒙尽力而为,Mac / Win 开着 App 时准时)—— 对外文案只说「检查时发现」,不承诺几分钟内。",
 "version": 1,
 "id": "waiting",
 "title": "等你授权提醒",
 "sub": "有 Claude Code 会话在等你点授权、等了一会儿还没人管时提醒",
 "i18n": {
  "en-US": {
   "title": "Approval wait alert",
   "sub": "Tells you when a Claude Code session has been waiting for your approval",
   "message": {
    "title": "${wProj} needs your approval",
    "body": "Waiting about ${wMins} min"
   },
   "form": {
    "perm": {
     "title": "Alert after waiting"
    }
   }
  }
 },
 "params": {
  "perm": "3"
 },
 "form": {
  "perm": {
   "title": "等了多久才提醒",
   "component": {
    "type": "radio",
    "props": {
     "items": [
      {
       "label": "1 分钟",
       "value": "1"
      },
      {
       "label": "3 分钟",
       "value": "3"
      },
      {
       "label": "10 分钟",
       "value": "10"
      },
      {
       "label": "30 分钟",
       "value": "30"
      }
     ]
    }
   }
  }
 },
 "events": {
  "onClick": "/live"
 },
 "task": {
  "depends": [
   {
    "flow": "@[file://xJob/flow/alert.df]",
    "params": {
     "perm": "${perm}",
     "long": "10"
    }
   }
  ],
  "then": {
   "flow": "@[file://xJob/flow/edge.df]",
   "params": {
    "key": "${waitKey}",
    "slot": "wait.${perm}"
   }
  },
  "refresh": {
   "interval": [
    "300"
   ]
  }
 },
 "alert": {
  "level": "urgent",
  "message": {
   "title": "${wProj} 在等你授权",
   "body": "已经等了约 ${wMins} 分钟"
  }
 }
}
